abstract: "Working-hypothesis methods/software checkpoint for two frozen particle-injection scenarios. Provides public source payloads, execution validators, and conditional pair-response mathematics. Contains no validated production helium, deuterium, or effective-neutrino-number prediction and no independent backend replication."
